# Forms & Validation

## Setup

```tsx
const methods = useZodForm(schema, defaultValues)
// wrap in <FormProvider {...methods}>
```

Schema files live beside pages: `validationSchema.tsx`.

## Fields

- Text: `BaseInputField` with `name` matching Zod key
- Status: `Controller` + `StatusDropdown`
- Entity pickers: `CountrySelect`, `CitySelect`

## Laravel 422 errors

Pass `methods.setError` to mutation hooks or handle in `onError`:

```ts
onError: (error) => {
  if (applyValidationErrors(error, setError)) return
  toast.error(getErrorMessage(error))
}
```

## i18n in schemas

Use message keys like `'requiredField'`, `'invalidEmail'` — resolved by Zod + i18n in forms.
